[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, and since the dice are rolled independently, the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
