[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, and since the dice are rolled independently, the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. **Determine the number of favorable outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    The difference between the two numbers rolled will be 0 if and only if the numbers on both dice are the same. The possible pairs of numbers that satisfy this condition are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
