[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m The triangle inequality theorem gives us the following conditions:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. \(8 + 8 > x\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. \(8 + x > 8\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 3. \(8 + x > 8\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
