[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m ### Step 1: Determine the voltage
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m First, we need to find the voltage \( V \) when \( I = 40 \) amperes and \( R = 3 \) ohms.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Using Ohm's law:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ V = IR \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ V = 40 \, \text{A} \times 3 \, \Omega \]
