[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. **Identify the prime numbers on a six-sided die:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    The numbers on a standard six-sided die are 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, and 6. The prime numbers among these are 2, 3, and 5.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. **Calculate the probability of rolling a non-prime number on one die:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    - There are 3 prime numbers (2, 3, 5) out of 6 possible outcomes.
