[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Therefore, the amount of current when the resistor has a resistance of 20 ohms is \(\boxed{6}\) amperes.
