[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Here, \( n = 15 \) and \( p = 3 \). We need to calculate:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \left\lfloor \frac{15}{3} \right\rfloor + \left\lfloor \frac{15}{3^2} \right\rfloor + \left\lfloor \frac{15}{3^3} \right\rfloor + \cdots
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Let's compute each term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
