[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Step 2: Substitute \(y = \frac{4x}{3}\) into the expression \(\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ \frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y} = \frac{2x + \frac{4x}{3}}{3x - 2\left(\frac{4x}{3}\right)} \]
