[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ \frac{150}{200} = \frac{3}{4} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Thus, the ratio of the acceleration of Jen's ball to Jack's ball is \(\frac{3}{4}\).
