[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ a_{\text{Jack}} = \frac{F_{\text{Jack}}}{m_{\text{baseball}}} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Given \(F_{\text{Jen}} = F_{\text{Jack}}\), we can substitute and find the ratio:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ \frac{a_{\text{Jen}}}{a_{\text{Jack}}} = \frac{\frac{F_{\text{Jen}}}{m_{\text{softball}}}}{\frac{F_{\text{Jack}}}{m_{\text{baseball}}}} = \frac{F_{\text{Jen}}}{m_{\text{softball}}} \cdot \frac{m_{\text{baseball}}}{F_{\text{Jack}}} = \frac{m_{\text{baseball}}}{m_{\text{softball}}} \]
