[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 4. **Conclusion:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    Since \( f(x) = \sqrt{x^2} = |x| \) and the absolute value function can take any non-negative value, the range of \( f(x) \) is all non-negative real numbers.
