[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ 2x + \frac{4x}{3} = \frac{6x}{3} + \frac{4x}{3} = \frac{10x}{3} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ 3x - 2\left(\frac{4x}{3}\right) = 3x - \frac{8x}{3} = \frac{9x}{3} - \frac{8x}{3} = \frac{x}{3} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Step 4: Substitute the simplified numerator and denominator back into the fraction.
