[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. **Population Growth Formulas:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    - The population of Rod after \( t + 5 \) hours is given by \( 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 2^{t+6} \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    - The population of Sphere after \( t \) hours is given by \( 8 \times 4^t = 2^3 \times (2^2)^t = 2^{3+2t} = 2^{2t+3} \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 3. **Set the Populations Equal:**
