[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ a_{\text{baseball}} = \frac{F}{m_{\text{baseball}}} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m We need to find the ratio of the acceleration of the softball to the acceleration of the baseball:
