[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ \frac{a_{\text{softball}}}{a_{\text{baseball}}} = \frac{0.15 \, \text{kg}}{0.2 \, \text{kg}} = \frac{15}{20} = \frac{3}{4} \]
