[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m [response] To determine the probability that the difference between the two numbers rolled on two fair, standard six-sided dice is 0, we can follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so when rolling two dice, the total number of possible outcomes is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. **Identify the favorable outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    The difference between the two numbers rolled will be 0 if the numbers on both dice are the same. The possible pairs where the numbers are the same are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
