[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    There are 6 such pairs.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 3. **Calculate the probability:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    The probability is the number of favorable outcomes divided by the total number of possible outcomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \frac{6}{36} = \frac{1}{6}
