[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[g\left(-\frac{6}{5}\right) = \frac{-2}{-\frac{6}{5}+1} = \frac{-2}{-\frac{1}{5}} = 10.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
