[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[(x + 8)(x - 3) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m So, the solutions are \(x = -8\) and \(x = 3\). Since we are considering \(x < 0\), we only take \(x = -8\).
