[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Let $a = b = c = d = x$. Then we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[4x + e = 8 \implies e = 8 - 4x\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m and
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[4x^2 + e^2 = 16 \implies 4x^2 + (8 - 4x)^2 = 16.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
