[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 3a + b = 2(2a - b) \implies 3a + b = 4a - 2b \implies 3b = a \implies \frac{a}{b} = 3.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \]
