[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \frac{(a+b)h}{2} = 3 \times \frac{(3b+a)h}{8} \implies 4(a+b) = 3(3b+a) \implies 4a + 4b = 9b + 3a \implies a = 5b.
