[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ D = \sqrt{x^2 + (x^2 - 5)^2} = \sqrt{x^2 + x^4 - 10x^2 + 25} = \sqrt{x^4 - 9x^2 + 25} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Let \(f(x) = x^4 - 9x^2 + 25\). To minimize \(D\), we minimize \(f(x)\). We take the derivative and set it to zero:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[ f'(x) = 4x^3 - 18x = 2x(2x^2 - 9) = 0 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m This gives us \(x = 0\) or \(x = \pm \frac{3\sqrt{2}}{2}\).
