[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    360 \div 2 = 180
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    180 \div 2 = 90
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    90 \div 2 = 45
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    So, \(720 = 2^4 \times 45\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 2. Next, factor 45:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    45 \div 3 = 15
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    15 \div 3 = 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    So, \(45 = 3^2 \times 5\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 3. Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    720 = 2^4 \times 3^2 \times 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 4. Now, we can take the square root of the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \sqrt{720} = \sqrt{2^4 \times 3^2 \times 5} = \sqrt{2^4} \times \sqrt{3^2} \times \sqrt{5} = 2^2 \times 3 \times \sqrt{5} = 4 \times 3 \times \sqrt{5} = 12\sqrt{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Thus, the simplified form of \(\sqrt{720}\) is \(\boxed{12\sqrt{5}}\).
