[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 1. **Volume of the cylindrical beaker:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    The formula for the volume of a cylinder is \( V = \pi r^2 h \).
