[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m Rearrange the equation to bring all terms to one side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m \[2a^2 + 4b^2 + c^2 - 4ab - 2ac = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 
