[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m 4. **Cosine Calculation**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    - The cosine of \(120^\circ\) is \(-\frac{1}{2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1412833)[0m    - The cosine of \(60^\circ\) is \(\frac{1}{2}\).
